{
 "total": 39.87,
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.147,
   "end": 0.994,
   "text": "KFC..."
  },
  {
   "start": 1.228,
   "end": 2.606,
   "text": "just filed for bankruptcy?!"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.88,
   "end": 4.394,
   "text": "Eighty-four restaurants at risk."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.588,
   "end": 6.381,
   "text": "Forty-four already shut down this year."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.575,
   "end": 8.214,
   "text": "Over sixteen hundred workers..."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.428,
   "end": 8.996,
   "text": "left hanging."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.29,
   "end": 10.876,
   "text": "But people still love fried chicken."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.07,
   "end": 11.412,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.706,
   "end": 12.328,
   "text": "what went wrong?"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.642,
   "end": 14.705,
   "text": "Sales dropped nearly sixteen percent."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.879,
   "end": 15.843,
   "text": "Costs kept rising."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.017,
   "end": 18.098,
   "text": "Profit per store crashed from twelve percent..."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.372,
   "end": 18.994,
   "text": "to just four."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.328,
   "end": 20.706,
   "text": "But here's what most people don't know."
  },
  {
   "start": 20.9,
   "end": 22.216,
   "text": "This isn't happening everywhere."
  },
  {
   "start": 22.65,
   "end": 23.785,
   "text": "It's happening in Texas."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.139,
   "end": 26.13,
   "text": "The company going bankrupt is Tasty Chick'n,"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.284,
   "end": 28.185,
   "text": "one of KFC's biggest franchisees."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.419,
   "end": 33.572,
   "text": "And KFC itself tried to cut ties, over fifteen point seven million dollars in unpaid fees."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.886,
   "end": 34.994,
   "text": "So who's really to blame:"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.148,
   "end": 36.68,
   "text": "the franchisee, or KFC?"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.954,
   "end": 38.846,
   "text": "Tell me in the comments, and follow for more!"
  }
 ]
}